  "payload": {
    "rawResponseText": "When owners in the Caribbean and Latin America want a **collection** or **soft-brand** option for a conversion, the brands most commonly considered are **Marriott’s Autograph Collection, Tribute Portfolio, and The Luxury Collection**, plus **Hilton’s Curio Collection by Hilton** and **Tapestry Collection by Hilton**.[1][4][5][6]\n\nA few additional soft-brand or conversion-friendly names that come up frequently in the region are **IHG’s Vignette Collection** and **voco hotels**, and **Accor’s Raffles, SLS, and Rixos** for higher-end/lifestyle conversion opportunities.[2][3][8]\n\nIf you want the answer narrowed specifically to the *most frequently cited conversion-friendly brands by company*, the short list is:\n\n- **Marriott:** The Luxury Collection, Autograph Collection Hotels, Tribute Portfolio, Delta Hotels by Marriott[1][4][7]\n- **Hilton:** Curio Collection by Hilton, Tapestry Collection by Hilton[6]\n- **IHG:** Vignette Collection, voco hotels[2][3]\n- **Accor:** Raffles, SLS, Rixos[8]",
